});
```

---

## What's Hard to Change

| Property | Difficulty | Notes |
|----------|-----------|-------|
| Canvas fingerprint | Medium | Needs JS override, detectable |
| WebRTC IP leak | Medium | Use `--disable-webrtc` flag |
| Font enumeration | Hard | System-level |
| TCP/IP fingerprint | Very Hard | OS-level |
| TLS fingerprint | Very Hard | Requires proxy |
| CPU/GPU actual behavior | Very Hard | Hardware-level |

---

## Launch Flags That Help
```javascript
const browser = await puppeteer.launch({
  args: [
    '--disable-blink-features=AutomationControlled', // Hide automation
    '--disable-webrtc',
    '--no-sandbox',
    '--disable-setuid-sandbox',
    '--disable-dev-shm-usage',
    '--lang=en-US,en',
  ]
});
```

---

## Better Alternatives

If fingerprint evasion is your goal, consider:
- **`puppeteer-extra`** + **`puppeteer-extra-plugin-stealth`** — handles many evasions automatically
- **Playwright** — has built-in stealth options
- **Browserless** — managed browser service

```javascript
const puppeteer = require('puppeteer-extra');
const StealthPlugin = require('puppeteer-extra-plugin-stealth');
puppeteer.use(StealthPlugin());
```

---

## Important Note
> Sophisticated fingerprinting services (Akamai, Cloudflare, DataDome) detect **behavioral patterns**, **timing anomalies**, and **inconsistencies** between spoofed values — not just individual properties.

